# MPLS-LDP-MIB, the pre-RFC 3815 module Cisco published, for
# ALCATEL-IND1-TIMETRA-LDP-MIB.
src/vendor/cisco
# TIMETRA-TC-MIB's TmnxOperState, for ALCATEL-STATIC-FRR-MIB. AOS 7 and
